<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-10-29T17:01:06.689Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 17:01:06 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Al Shabaab fighters are clashing with Turkish-trained Somali troops in Lower Shabelle and ambushing units near Baidoa, while a former al-Shabaab finance chief was killed in a joint operation by Somali intelligence and security forces in the same region. African Union peacekeepers are withdrawing from four bases in Lower Shabelle, and the UN political mission in Somalia has ended without a replacement to address the unresolved election dispute. Ethiopia has received Russian fighter jets, with S‑400 air-defence systems slated to follow, indicating a new external military dimension. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxNSE84VGhwOGdhbkZGY1NNQXBYUURlSlRXMTF2ZWk2VmQ1MEhWTEJwTndFcFZwMUx2Uzk2cjNrN1VpMmFKU0pudkE2cEJ3cEllbkI1cHlJZG44SzdSekd2ay05NmROTzloY19LMXBBMVI1OXVLaXdzSW5lRk5IZVkzMXJ6aERNeXJTdlRJU2kwaHV0SUdfRElCRA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPNzdxT0hGaF8yc29NbWhvQWJvcXEyLXNPTVMtOE9sSTNDMEYyNXNfVXowTGJaaGdSbFNtNnR3ZjBTTGt5Ry1PQnNRbHlSWG9OZFprY0p3SXhUYzlTQ05HYjYxQmk0dnA3ZjcyOFVlb0Q1azItTVFja3ZEVFdYdFhQaTQyZDYyWW5nXzktMm43Y3dDQXBvekJxc0xMMkM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE40U2xka1ZmVW04THNGQXczdTJyQ0M4MV9tVXJnenZ3c1VRUlV0dWt1a3Z0cFp0dTF2Wml2QVhMRkVMZE1hVzhDTw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUkFVX3lxTE1IcVphQmZ1a2pjSnp6blhVNlV1ZDNSYWJPUE9LS3BLczUzUnUzeGxxbjNMaEhobVV1SnUwLVRTanRXQ0VMSzVCQXFDWTNwVF9uT3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Addis Standard&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Mother Jones&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxONk5KTUNZVkdraW